			<p style="text-align: justify; font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Discover some of the most inclusive, environmentally sensitive 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK and 5 BHK residential flats / apartment in Ahmedabad and Vadodara.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: justify; font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Residential projects by Bakeri Group are design optimised for young couples, senior citizens, and families, alike.</span></p>

