			<p style="text-align: justify; font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Office spaces by Bakeri Group are designed for optimal natural light and ventilation, with special attention to heat proofing, energy conservation, adequate parking spots, EV charging points, and spacious lobbies and floors.</span></p>
